WEBVTT

00:25:29.250 --> 00:25:30.518
EP: Just the same.

00:25:30.542 --> 00:25:33.184
Trust with your eyes open
means that you --

00:25:33.208 --> 00:25:37.309
But it's not trust
and be suspicious the whole time.

00:25:37.333 --> 00:25:39.809
You know, if you are
in this cortisol level,

00:25:39.833 --> 00:25:42.809
high cortisol levels of constant
checking, checking, checking,

00:25:42.833 --> 00:25:44.101
you're not trusting.

00:25:44.125 --> 00:25:47.434
You know, I can have all your codes --
it's the same in relationships,

00:25:47.458 --> 00:25:50.018
when people say,
"Give me all your passwords,"

00:25:50.042 --> 00:25:51.601
who trusts on that?

00:25:51.625 --> 00:25:55.184
You do surveillance,
but the surveillance doesn't breed trust.

00:25:55.208 --> 00:25:57.809
AG: I like to give my passwords
in case I forget them.

00:25:57.833 --> 00:25:58.851
(Laughter)

00:25:58.875 --> 00:26:00.351
But maybe a different dynamic.